    {
      "id": "u06-1",
      "title": "Eat, drink, have",
      "explanation": [
        "Afrikaans verbs **never change** for the person: **ek eet, jy eet, hulle eet**. Much easier than English!",
        "**Ek eet** means both *I eat* and *I am eating*.",
        "**het** = have / has: **Ek het 'n hond.**"
      ],
      "examples": [
        {
          "af": "Ek eet brood.",
          "en": "I'm eating bread."
        },
        {
          "af": "Sy drink koffie.",
          "en": "She drinks coffee."
        },
        {
          "af": "Ons drink water.",
          "en": "We drink water."
        },
        {
          "af": "Hulle het twee katte.",
          "en": "They have two cats."
        }
      ],
      "vocab": [
        "het",
        "eet",
        "drink",
        "water",
        "koffie",
        "brood",
        "melk"
      ],
      "exercises": [
        {
          "type": "fill",
          "af": "Hy ___ koffie. (drinks)",
          "en": "He drinks coffee.",
          "answers": [
            "drink"
          ],
          "options": [
            "drink",
            "drinks",
            "drinking"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "translate",
          "from": "en",
          "prompt": "I am eating bread.",
          "answers": [
            "Ek eet brood."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "translate",
          "from": "en",
          "prompt": "We have a dog.",
          "answers": [
            "Ons het 'n hond."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "order",
          "en": "She drinks milk.",
          "af": "Sy drink melk."
        },
        {
          "type": "translate",
          "from": "af",
          "prompt": "Hulle het drie katte.",
          "answers": [
            "They have three cats."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "choice",
          "question": "**Ek eet** can mean…",
          "options": [
            "both \"I eat\" and \"I am eating\"",
            "only \"I eat\"",
            "only \"I ate\""
          ],
          "answer": "both \"I eat\" and \"I am eating\""
        },
        {
          "type": "fill",
          "af": "Ons ___ twee honde. (have)",
          "en": "We have two dogs.",
          "answers": [
            "het"
          ],
          "options": [
            "het",
            "is",
            "eet"
          ]
        }
      ]
